brainPICK bundles the following libraries. Each keeps its own license, the texts are in
node_modules/<package>/LICENSE after an install. Versions are the ones this repository
installs from package.json, checked against the installed packages.

tinykeys 4.0.1: the keyboard shortcuts
MIT
https://github.com/jamiebuilds/tinykeys

The fonts of the interface are bundled with the app (latin subsets, woff2 and woff, imported
from the Fontsource packages by the root layout), so the page asks no font service for them.
Each is under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, the full text is in
node_modules/@fontsource/<font>/LICENSE after an install:

